    "text": "KCRG.com\nwebsite\nFairfax\nFairfax city workers started asking questions about unpermitted wells weeks ago\nBy Brian Tabick,\n1 days agoFAIRFAX, Iowa (KCRG) - The city of Fairfax said it had started looking into illegal wells being dug at the site of the two Cedar Rapids data centers weeks ago. According to Fairfax Water Department Supervisor Brian Merta, he was having a conversation with the company that was digging a city well when he was told that the company was then going to dig wells in the “Big Cedar” Industrial area.\n3",
